1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:05,035
W: Lars, would you mind listening to me rehearse my presentation for this afternoon's meeting.

2
00:00:05,915 --> 00:00:08,155
I want to make sure I get everything right.

3
00:00:09,890 --> 00:00:10,735
M: Can you wait a few minutes?

4
00:00:11,495 --> 00:00:14,585
I have to write an e-mail to my boss about the department's budget.

5
00:00:14,975 --> 00:00:17,115
W: Sure, it's fine for me to wait.

6
00:00:18,310 --> 00:00:20,095
M: What are you going to be talking about anyway?

7
00:00:20,795 --> 00:00:22,875
I wasn't even aware there's a meeting later today.

8
00:00:23,655 --> 00:00:27,555
W: It was called last night after almost everyone had gone home for the day.

9
00:00:28,055 --> 00:00:31,185
I'll be talking about the effects of the new marketing campaign.

10
00:00:32,170 --> 00:00:34,095
M: Oh, I heard things are going well.

11
00:00:34,835 --> 00:00:36,665
I trust you have good news for everyone.
